node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored `android/` and `ios/` match a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded the config
# plugins' native sources under modules/*/android and modules/*/ios — that is
# why modules/blechat and modules/eventpulse-ble are absent from this repo even
# though plugins/withBleChatNative.js and plugins/withEventPulseBle.js copy from
# them on every prebuild. Only the generated Expo output at the root is build
# output; modules/ is hand-written source and must be committed.
/android/
/ios/
*.log
